description = A card game to discover and experiment agile methods
tag-line = Drive your software development business to success by mastering agile practices
summary =
    You're the head of a small video game company and determined to grow it.

    Which choices will be the wisest?
    Increase team size or invest in agile practices?
    Foster production capacity or embed values?

    In this card game combining strategy and luck, experience and discuss the importance of agile values and practices.